{"ref":"BDB, עֵ֫דֶן³","hw":"עֵ֫דֶן³","html":"† III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵ֫דֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.terr. (</strong>prob. associated by Heb. with i. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדֶן</span><strong>)</strong>;—district in which lay garden of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, home of Adam and Eve: <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטַּע גַּן־בְּעֵדֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:8\" href=\"/Genesis.2.8\">Gn 2:8</a>, river <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹצֵא מֵע׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:10\" href=\"/Genesis.2.10\">10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִדְמַת־ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:16\" href=\"/Genesis.4.16\">4:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן־ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:15\" href=\"/Genesis.2.15\">2:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:23\" href=\"/Genesis.3.23\">3:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:24\" href=\"/Genesis.3.24\">24</a> (all 𝔊 Εδεμ); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּגַן־ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.35\">Ez 36:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:3\" href=\"/Joel.2.3\">Jo 2:3</a> and <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.3\">Is 51:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן־י׳</span>), all sim. of fertility; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ גַּן־אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.13\">Ez 28:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצֵי ע׳ אֲשֶׁר בְּגַן הָאֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.9\">31:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצֵי ע׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (𝔊 Ez Jo ἡ τρυφή; Is παράδεισος).","next":"BDB, עֶ֫דֶן","prev":"BDB, עדן²"}